From: Hasan Mehdi <hasanthemehdi@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:15:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 11/15] bluedroid/osi: filesize() is ffilesize() since the
 rebase

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 lib/bluedroid/osi/config.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/lib/bluedroid/osi/config.c b/lib/bluedroid/osi/config.c
index 7c5cad25..3c6d16c2 100644
--- a/lib/bluedroid/osi/config.c
+++ b/lib/bluedroid/osi/config.c
@@ -356,7 +356,7 @@ static int get_config_size_from_flash(int fp)
 {
     assert(fp != 0);
 
-    size_t length = filesize(fp);
+    size_t length = ffilesize(fp);
     return length;
 }
 
